{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05这类短停留段仍堆了不少同时可见的感受词，纵向交替扫读不如X左右分栏来得利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把关键心理转折用加亮词直接标出，话与感受交替呈现，也更容易看出从害怕添负担、确认对方没有退开，到盼望互相需要、害怕失去，最后接受不确定的完整推进。它的音乐、身体和情绪感受更加细腻具体，部分感受还随乐句出现，能让观众感受到情绪如何一步步变化。X更利于快速扫读，但Y在人物心理层次、叙事连贯性和音乐感受的丰富程度上整体更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ed65294a-9c47-4573-90cd-a6a217b07393", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062306605120Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.157, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:25:18.774991+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e8ca233ce9cb9ba69b4c619b8010f798c1438fa7f6bde66c75ea9520e8a9adf9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "